OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FHeavy showers continue to move
OL,6,Feastward through the morning with
OL,7,Fisolated showers following in behind.
OL,8,FAnother rather warm day ahead, with
OL,9,Ftemperatures above average for the
OL,10,Ftime of year.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBright end to the afternoon
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells giving way to clear
OL,14,Fspells overnight. Turning increasing
OL,15,Fcloudy from the west from midnight
OL,16,Fwith outbreaks of heavy and thundery
OL,17,Frain arriving.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
