OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cloudy and wet start with
OL,6,Frain, clearing to east during the
OL,7,Fmorning. Turning brighter from the
OL,8,Fwest with sunny spells and showers
OL,9,Ffollowing.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:
OL,12,FUnsettled throughout with showers,
OL,13,Fthese locally heavy and with thundery.
OL,14,FStaying warm to start with but turning
OL,15,Ffresher as winds shift to a westerly
OL,16,Fand strengthen from Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
